{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/c7748da4e519656bf947441ae274fc89.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</strong> is a retro-futuristic roguelike action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast, evolve faster\u2014each stage is a battle of growth between you and an ever-changing enemy force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/5e551714e9ab96f333114b894005c589.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cInsert the Cartridge. In that moment, you evolve.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Zero One</i>, the last hope of a fallen planet, on a mission to find the missing scientist, Dr. Evelyn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero One is the only being capable of unlocking the hidden power inside the retro game Cartridges she left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within those nostalgic shells lies the immense power Victor has been desperately seeking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue Evelyn and reclaim your world from Victor\u2019s Overmind Legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike combat where enemies evolve too</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/7811fb764790fc8b1d34fd6589c944b6.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legion grows stronger with every stage. Adapt with your own evolving strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless boss battles that keep you on edge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/ec65c115dfe5626e7851d4a81c59884e.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable patterns and rapid attacks make every encounter a tense and unforgiving fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and upgrade powerful Cartridges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/7657693deb8c25c118bb39cd640a847a.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>Hack enemy facilities to unlock new weapons and temporary upgrades that shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich sci-fi world with bold visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b4e847d4f32521a3abdccefa43a8ee0b.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the missing scientist, explore ruins of forgotten tech, and unlock the secrets of Zero One.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every failure leads to growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/f0ddec562982840e9aaa09d0b0648102.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even defeat gives you data to grow stronger. Learn, upgrade, and try again in a loop of relentless progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find all the retro game cartridge, evolve to the ultimate level, and reclaim the planet ruled by the Overmind legion!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867650?t=1755243499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/eabd5e9272500856f170439d4b3c9ad5bea6afff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755243499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/0e48cd396e018db8b847f638bee7ff2e2870cdb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755243499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/0e48cd396e018db8b847f638bee7ff2e2870cdb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755243499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/c7748da4e519656bf947441ae274fc89.avif?t=1755243499\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</strong> is a retro-futuristic roguelike action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast, evolve faster\u2014each stage is a battle of growth between you and an ever-changing enemy force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38